<title>USA: Pittsburgh Home sets five pct buyback.</title>
<headline>Pittsburgh Home sets five pct buyback.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pittsburgh Home Financial Corp Wednesday said its board has authorized the repurchase of up to 103,650 shares, or about five percent of the company's outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>Repurchases are authorized to be made by the company from time to time in open-market transactions as, in the opinion of management, market conditions warrant.</p>
<p>The repurchased shares will be held as treasury stock and will be available for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
